\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl184\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  LORD regard my earnest cry,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl184\slmult0 A potsherd of the earth;
\par A poor guilty worm am I,
\par A Canaanite by birth:
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Save me from this tyranny,
\par From all the power of Satan save;
\par Mercy, mercy upon me,
\par Thou Son of David, have!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl184\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  To the sheep of Israel's fold
\par \pard\li225\sl184\slmult0 Thou in thy flesh wast sent;
\par Yet the gentiles now behold
\par In Thee their covenant:
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par See me then, with pity see,
\par A sinner whom thou came'st to save
\par Mercy, mercy, upon me,
\par Thou Son of David, have!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl184\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Still I cannot part with thee,
\par \pard\li225\sl184\slmult0 I will not let thee go:
\par Mercy, mercy upon me,
\par Thou Son of David, show!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Vilest of the sinful race,
\par On thee, importunate, I call,
\par Help me, Jesus, show thy grace;
\par Thy grace is free for all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl184\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Nothing am I in thy sight,
\par \pard\li225\sl184\slmult0 Nothing have I to plead;
\par Unto dogs it is not right
\par To cast the children's bread:
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Yet the dogs the crumbs may eat
\par That drops from the master's table
\par Let the fragments be my meat;
\par Thy grace is free for all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl184\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Give me, Lord, the victory,
\par \pard\li225\sl184\slmult0 My heart's desire fulfil;
\par Let it now be done to me
\par According to thy will!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Give me living bread to eat,
\par And say, in answer to my call,
\par 'Canaanite, thy faith is great!
\par My grace is free for all.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl184\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. If thy grace for all is free,
\par \pard\li225\sl184\slmult0 Thy call now let me hear;
\par Show this token upon me,
\par And bring salvation near;
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl184\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par      Now the gracious word repeat,
\par      The word of healing to my soul,
\par      'Canaanite, thy faith is great!
\par      Thy faith hath made thee whole.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

